  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to develop a financing strategy and medium-term expenditure framework to support an increasing government financial contribution to the programme. This will complement separate ongoing collaboration with the Government to improve the efficiency and effectiveness of its business and investment policies, that will allow Tanzania to boost revenue collection and increase public expenditure for social protection.</narrative>
  </description>
